l i5 6600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600"],["Memory","2048 MB RAM"],["Graphics","Nvidia Geforce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 380"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","3 GB available space"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"Mosaic is a narrative adventure about a lonely office worker in a cold, gray city. You go through your daily routine, commuting and working in a faceless corporation, while strange and surreal moments start to break through.\n\nThe game lasts about two to three hours and focuses on mood and story rather than challenge. It explores loneliness and the search for meaning in modern life. It suits players who enjoy thoughtful, artistic games."}}